remark: Martini 2.2 bead radii for HOLE (generated by tools/martini_rad.py)
remark: bead types: marrink-lab/vermouth-martinize@cfcad6ecc231 martini22/{05-aminoacids.ff,15-nucleotides.ff} (Apache-2.0)
remark: bead size:  0.47 nm, ring (S*) beads 0.43 nm - Marrink et al. (2007)
remark:             J. Phys. Chem. B 111, 7812; de Jong et al. (2013) JCTC 9, 687
remark: water W/WF/PW and ions NA+/CL- (and NA/CL) added from the same papers
remark: radius = sigma/2. Residue names are the 3 characters HOLE reads.
remark: HOLE reads at most 100 VDWR lines: a bead at the regular size has no
remark: line of its own, the last line covers it.
VDWR SC1  HID 2.15
